.SH "نام (NAME)"
crystal-tool-format \- Format Crystal source files
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBcrystal tool format\fP [options] [source.\|.\|.]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Format project, directories and/or files with the coding
style used in the standard library.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-check\fP
.RS 4
Only check conformity but do not apply any changes.
.RE